# Robinhood MCP Guardrails

Apply when using **Robinhood Trading MCP** (`https://agent.robinhood.com/mcp/trading`) or when the user mentions Robinhood positions, Agentic account, or MCP portfolio data.

If MCP tools fail with **-32600 / structured content**, confirm `.cursor/mcp.json` matches [mcp.json.example](../mcp.json.example) (proxy + `mcp-remote`). See [mcp-cursor-compat.md](../../project-docs/reference/mcp-cursor-compat.md).

## Read vs trade

| Action | Allowed |
|--------|---------|
| List accounts, positions, balances, order history | All accounts |
| Place/modify/cancel orders | **Robinhood Agentic account only** |
| Trades on IRA or taxable via MCP | **Never** |

## Phase 5 gate

**No autonomous execution before Phase 5** ([PROJECT.md](PROJECT.md)).

- Default: **read-only** MCP usage.
- Do not invoke order-placement MCP tools unless the user explicitly requests a specific trade and confirms account + size.
- After any trade (Phase 5+): log to `trader-memory-core` via `thesis_store.py`.

## Portfolio B (IRA)

- Read positions via MCP if available.
- Every options recommendation: **IRA-eligible: Yes/No**.
- Permitted: long calls/puts, covered calls, cash-secured puts.
- Not permitted: naked selling, undefined-risk spreads.

## Thesis logging

- Never write YAML directly under `state/theses/`.
- Use [commands/log-positions.md](commands/log-positions.md) or `thesis_store.py` / thesis-manager.
- Two sources: `state/pending_ingest.json` (sync) or live MCP snapshot (same four questions).

## Hybrid with scripts

- Daily market: `uv run python3 scripts/pre_market.py` (not MCP).
- Scheduled taxable sync: `robinhood_sync.py` + timer — keep even when MCP works.

## Account keys

| Portfolio | `thesis_store` account |
|-----------|------------------------|
| A taxable | `robinhood_taxable` |
| B IRA | `ira_robinhood` |
| C Agentic | `robinhood_agentic` |

See account discovery table in [decisions.md](decisions.md).
